ademy-id "q-158304" :question/problem "Compute $P(X\\le -1)$ given that the random variable $X$ has the probability density function\n\n$$\nf(x)={\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3}{35}{x}^{2},\\, & -2\\le x\\le 3, \\\\ 0,\\, & \\text{otherwise.}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "If a continuous random variable $X$ has the probability density function $f(x),$ then \n\n$$\nP(a\\le X\\le b)={\\int }_{a}^{b}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nSince $f(x)$ is identical to zero for all $x<-2,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(X\\le -1) & ={\\int }_{-2}^{-1}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-2}^{-1}\\frac{3}{35}{x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={[\\frac{1}{35}{x}^{3}]}_{-2}^{-1} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{35}[(-1)^{3}-(-2)^{3}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{35}(-1+8) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{35}\\cdot 7 \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-158304/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "1e723a34-c6e1-5827-87ad-866cbaeef98c"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-158304"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-158454/selection/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5" :answer/id #uuid "8895af1a-36d5-5abd-83e0-50fd84037cfd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158454/selection/b05ae51c7e0f9ce8edef362b0e3bfd104c905bad9c2676254ee36131cb916baa" :answer/id #uuid "cb60b298-2d9e-54a8-bf39-d0e4ae442527" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5}{8}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158454/selection/d427b944e26709d5f365fc6b5711be004a0a3509f614cbfd4943dc70d3f6d84e" :answer/id #uuid "fe72b249-b61e-558a-a5dc-43986c91fb7e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{8}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158454/selection/a272cbe64fea514fe5c8c9685aef2c9378fdfe44c54941c8bcba64a5f713bc84" :answer/id #uuid "a64852e3-1625-5597-9171-f3f3f09e68b9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{7}{8}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158454/selection/b93157e0eb36ec8e645eeabaa0819400f448209e0db24c1abf59704822466393" :answer/id #uuid "a3faf377-ad50-5425-8315-6f8684066f7e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158454/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "f40d7bde-1dda-52ec-bfd6-41c200409d55" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-158454/selection/a272cbe64fea514fe5c8c9685aef2c9378fdfe44c54941c8bcba64a5f713bc84" :answer-field/choices ["q-158454/selection/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5" "q-158454/selection/b05ae51c7e0f9ce8edef362b0e3bfd104c905bad9c2676254ee36131cb916baa" "q-158454/selection/d427b944e26709d5f365fc6b5711be004a0a3509f614cbfd4943dc70d3f6d84e" "q-158454/selection/a272cbe64fea514fe5c8c9685aef2c9378fdfe44c54941c8bcba64a5f713bc84" "q-158454/selection/b93157e0eb36ec8e645eeabaa0819400f448209e0db24c1abf59704822466393"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-158454" :question/id #uuid "cf0e3a92-9f57-5c19-8c59-f00566822c2d" :question/math-academy-id "q-158454" :question/problem "Compute $P(X\\ge 2)$ given that the random variable $X$ has the probability density function\n\n$$\nf(x)={\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3}{34}({x}^{3}-{x}^{2}),\\, & 1\\le x\\le 3, \\\\ 0,\\, & \\text{otherwise.}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "If a continuous random variable $X$ has the probability density function $f(x),$ then \n\n$$\nP(a\\le X\\le b)={\\int }_{a}^{b}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nSince $f(x)$ is identical to zero for all $x>3,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(X\\ge 2) & ={\\int }_{2}^{3}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{2}^{3}\\frac{3}{34}({x}^{3}-{x}^{2})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{34}{\\int }_{2}^{3}{x}^{3}-{x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{34}{[\\frac{1}{4}{x}^{4}-\\frac{1}{3}{x}^{3}]}_{2}^{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{34}([\\frac{1}{4}(3)^{4}-\\frac{1}{3}(3)^{3}]-[\\frac{1}{4}(2)^{4}-\\frac{1}{3}(2)^{3}]) \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{34}([\\frac{81}{4}-9]-[4-\\frac{8}{3}]) \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{34}\\cdot \\frac{119}{12} \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{8}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-158454/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "1e723a34-c6e1-5827-87ad-866cbaeef98c"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-158454"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-158309/selection/9c6bfb4db8d042ca3b93589c844ac1c789909e0099f428d8083546a00b4d8cf7" :answer/id #uuid "1a8691a2-4664-5e5a-a274-5021bdf28f39" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{9}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158309/selection/3a3e10526f40c673b7703a3c103fe7589223997acb2a083d0e3a20b742c55555" :answer/id #uuid "807d00cb-0e14-5752-b513-426b9e1e21b7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{8}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158309/selection/9e11fa4df3725c69efaf2fb0a82d90e47a4519d002f721e23606c3d6290fb02c" :answer/id #uuid "5905e17b-fd6d-5adf-bccf-7f54c4453a7e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{6}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158309/selection/9700accffa78065d8053126335d2ac4e2336d0d88c76df9e6a237030f752585a" :answer/id #uuid "d7f0cb36-df86-55e3-b085-495da2fbb4c5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{4}{9}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158309/selection/d427b944e26709d5f365fc6b5711be004a0a3509f614cbfd4943dc70d3f6d84e" :answer/id #uuid "660a1e8d-e8f8-53ee-815e-47dd6a346b18" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{8}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158309/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "22881c31-f713-5841-be94-f3bf570eed8f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-158309/selection/9700accffa78065d8053126335d2ac4e2336d0d88c76df9e6a237030f752585a" :answer-field/choices ["q-158309/selection/9c6bfb4db8d042ca3b93589c844ac1c789909e0099f428d8083546a00b4d8cf7" "q-158309/selection/3a3e10526f40c673b7703a3c103fe7589223997acb2a083d0e3a20b742c55555" "q-158309/selection/9e11fa4df3725c69efaf2fb0a82d90e47a4519d002f721e23606c3d6290fb02c" "q-158309/selection/9700accffa78065d8053126335d2ac4e2336d0d88c76df9e6a237030f752585a" "q-158309/selection/d427b944e26709d5f365fc6b5711be004a0a3509f614cbfd4943dc70d3f6d84e"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-158309" :question/id #uuid "85c3d5c4-3104-52f7-8a7e-28306e437eaf" :question/math-academy-id "q-158309" :question/problem "Compute $P(X\\le 3)$ given that the random variable $X$ has the probability density function\n\n$$\nf(x)={\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{24}({x}^{2}+1),\\, & 1\\le x\\le 4, \\\\ 0,\\, & \\text{otherwise.}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "If a continuous random variable $X$ has the probability density function $f(x),$ then \n\n$$\nP(a\\le X\\le b)={\\int }_{a}^{b}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nSince $f(x)$ is identical to zero for all $x<1,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(X\\le 3) & ={\\int }_{1}^{3}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{3}\\frac{1}{24}({x}^{2}+1)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{24}{\\int }_{1}^{3}{x}^{2}+1\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{24}{[\\frac{{x}^{3}}{3}+x]}_{1}^{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{24}[(\\frac{{3}^{3}}{3}+3)-(\\frac{1}{3}+1)] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{24}(12-\\frac{4}{3}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{24}\\cdot \\frac{32}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{9}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-158309/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "1e723a34-c6e1-5827-87ad-866cbaeef98c"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-158309"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-158436/selection/99f48c1b72e8eeab33eba2584ff0661456642ba13c82a72d98a76e8e1a07563e" :answer/id #uuid "e3c9e206-083e-5758-b879-66a0b522fbf8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158436/selection/b93157e0eb36ec8e645eeabaa0819400f448209e0db24c1abf59704822466393" :answer/id #uuid "51ab03ff-fd7f-50d5-b680-e095b72fe269" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158436/selection/0d247918008ed78cc89a6965d62d9f4a8fe02d275ec22142df80e82512aa1ea1" :answer/id #uuid "6be4ef2a-4dfd-5522-b090-1511b57a078a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{7}{12}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158436/selection/21bc1f5ac2b6db8ca11973d9b85c1eeb6af2cd920b556e0cf3d98ab9a728286a" :answer/id #uuid "8c2c7783-498a-534c-889c-1b6ed8428e9f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5}{6}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158436/selection/1512fbc4ba9ac54935748bd30a3df0f8adcca19968544e9199178dd45a802f05" :answer/id #uuid "41ade935-ca9f-592b-b040-91e5333de0db" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5}{12}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158436/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "f03bc6a4-9ed7-5697-a80a-d31d2a2f8a69" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-158436/selection/0d247918008ed78cc89a6965d62d9f4a8fe02d275ec22142df80e82512aa1ea1" :answer-field/choices ["q-158436/selection/99f48c1b72e8eeab33eba2584ff0661456642ba13c82a72d98a76e8e1a07563e" "q-158436/selection/b93157e0eb36ec8e645eeabaa0819400f448209e0db24c1abf59704822466393" "q-158436/selection/0d247918008ed78cc89a6965d62d9f4a8fe02d275ec22142df80e82512aa1ea1" "q-158436/selection/21bc1f5ac2b6db8ca11973d9b85c1eeb6af2cd920b556e0cf3d98ab9a728286a" "q-158436/selection/1512fbc4ba9ac54935748bd30a3df0f8adcca19968544e9199178dd45a802f05"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-158436" :question/id #uuid "997215ba-5db0-5cc7-bb9c-ac5ba657c4ba" :question/math-academy-id "q-158436" :question/problem "Compute $P(0\\le X\\le 2)$ given that the random variable $X$ has the probability density function\n\n$$\nf(x)={\\begin{aligned}\\frac{2}{5}x(x+1),\\, & 0\\le x<1, \\\\ \\frac{1}{6}x & 1\\le x\\le 3, \\\\ 0,\\, & \\text{otherwise.}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "If a continuous random variable $X$ has the probability density function $f(x),$ then \n\n$$\nP(a\\le X\\le b)={\\int }_{a}^{b}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nSo, in our case, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(0\\le X\\le 2) & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{2}{5}x(x+1)\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{1}^{2}\\frac{1}{6}x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{2}{5}({x}^{2}+x)\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{1}^{2}\\frac{1}{6}x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{5}{[\\frac{1}{3}{x}^{3}+\\frac{1}{2}{x}^{2}]}_{0}^{1}+{[\\frac{1}{12}{x}^{2}]}_{1}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{5}([\\frac{1}{3}(1)^{3}+\\frac{1}{2}(1)^{2}]-[\\frac{1}{3}(0)^{3}+\\frac{1}{2}(0)^{2}])+\\frac{1}{12}[{2}^{2}-{1}^{2}] \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{5}(\\frac{5}{6})+\\frac{1}{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}+\\frac{1}{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{12}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-158436/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "17408f35-ef57-5eb2-8cb6-3a946194d2d3"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-158436"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-158415/selection/1512fbc4ba9ac54935748bd30a3df0f8adcca19968544e9199178dd45a802f05" :answer/id #uuid "67224693-cc96-58b0-b346-59c6273369ee" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5}{12}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158415/selection/21bc1f5ac2b6db8ca11973d9b85c1eeb6af2cd920b556e0cf3d98ab9a728286a" :answer/id #uuid "3722cff6-bc0a-5d86-a829-d774474a396a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5}{6}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158415/selection/9e11fa4df3725c69efaf2fb0a82d90e47a4519d002f721e23606c3d6290fb02c" :answer/id #uuid "368967a2-9d69-58d9-b55a-0d9518749f2c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{6}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158415/selection/b93157e0eb36ec8e645eeabaa0819400f448209e0db24c1abf59704822466393" :answer/id #uuid "33cd8734-5b15-53bf-bed3-5bf32a7cf443" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158415/selection/0d247918008ed78cc89a6965d62d9f4a8fe02d275ec22142df80e82512aa1ea1" :answer/id #uuid "833ad217-2289-558b-af29-312d1d686ea8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{7}{12}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158415/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "f184288c-d128-50e2-ab84-0e0d249c368a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-158415/selection/1512fbc4ba9ac54935748bd30a3df0f8adcca19968544e9199178dd45a802f05" :answer-field/choices ["q-158415/selection/1512fbc4ba9ac54935748bd30a3df0f8adcca19968544e9199178dd45a802f05" "q-158415/selection/21bc1f5ac2b6db8ca11973d9b85c1eeb6af2cd920b556e0cf3d98ab9a728286a" "q-158415/selection/9e11fa4df3725c69efaf2fb0a82d90e47a4519d002f721e23606c3d6290fb02c" "q-158415/selection/b93157e0eb36ec8e645eeabaa0819400f448209e0db24c1abf59704822466393" "q-158415/selection/0d247918008ed78cc89a6965d62d9f4a8fe02d275ec22142df80e82512aa1ea1"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-158415" :question/id #uuid "95c89b76-387e-5207-81b9-29146c50eb5b" :question/math-academy-id "q-158415" :question/problem "Compute $P(2<X\\le 3)$ given that the random variable $X$ has the probability density function\n\n$$\nf(x)={\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{6}x,\\, & 1\\le x\\le 3, \\\\ \\frac{1}{3} & 3<x\\le 4, \\\\ 0,\\, & \\text{otherwise.}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "If a continuous random variable $X$ has the probability density function $f(x),$ then \n\n$$\nP(a<X\\le b)={\\int }_{a}^{b}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nSo, in our case, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(2<X\\le 3) & ={\\int }_{2}^{3}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{2}^{3}\\frac{1}{6}x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={[\\frac{1}{12}{x}^{2}]}_{2}^{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{12}[{3}^{2}-{2}^{2}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{12}(9-4) \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{12}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-158415/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "17408f35-ef57-5eb2-8cb6-3a946194d2d3"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-158415"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-158420/selection/1512fbc4ba9ac54935748bd30a3df0f8adcca19968544e9199178dd45a802f05" :answer/id #uuid "71f1b8e9-3c3e-528d-87d2-9134c0cd6d62" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5}{12}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158420/selection/5b6a7457ecf38e757655a8ab80cd7dca24376644ed8b5d929a23fb6af65f88f0" :answer/id #uuid "3d909980-0bf4-55ac-86d5-63b1aa81e5c8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5}{9}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158420/selection/92c1d392da612bf23a12b48c648e5003b4e4ccf22e9ff4c222bc2b4909eaa812" :answer/id #uuid "6a7a2705-c9f3-54e5-8114-95144d10e5a9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{13}{18}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158420/selection/e3b46c3e63ee8ef5a071cd8ef5f7250114c0c6983477af061861d82a06039d46" :answer/id #uuid "487e2ef8-6d1d-52ba-bda3-fcd9d1f47688" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{9}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158420/selection/be80c4b10c2262e7165b2c3683cd66c82685822ebb5d747b205d67fb1d4622e1" :answer/id #uuid "d0de70b6-e0b9-57a4-acd7-2c3424505756" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5}{18}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158420/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "7dd41cce-e9a8-5cfb-bb8e-7c317afd0ee6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-158420/selection/be80c4b10c2262e7165b2c3683cd66c82685822ebb5d747b205d67fb1d4622e1" :answer-field/choices ["q-158420/selection/1512fbc4ba9ac54935748bd30a3df0f8adcca19968544e9199178dd45a802f05" "q-158420/selection/5b6a7457ecf38e757655a8ab80cd7dca24376644ed8b5d929a23fb6af65f88f0" "q-158420/selection/92c1d392da612bf23a12b48c648e5003b4e4ccf22e9ff4c222bc2b4909eaa812" "q-158420/selection/e3b46c3e63ee8ef5a071cd8ef5f7250114c0c6983477af061861d82a06039d46" "q-158420/selection/be80c4b10c2262e7165b2c3683cd66c82685822ebb5d747b205d67fb1d4622e1"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-158420" :question/id #uuid "cc19abda-ad88-5df7-a150-331010d50f44" :question/math-academy-id "q-158420" :question/problem "Compute $P(3<X<4)$ given that the random variable $X$ has the probability density function\n\n$$\nf(x)={\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3}{4}{x}^{2},\\, & -1\\le x\\le 1, \\\\ \\frac{1}{9}(x-1) & 1<x\\le 4, \\\\ 0,\\, & \\text{otherwise.}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "If a continuous random variable $X$ has the probability density function $f(x),$ then \n\n$$\nP(a<X<b)={\\int }_{a}^{b}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nSo, in our case, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(3<X<4) & ={\\int }_{3}^{4}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{3}^{4}\\frac{1}{9}(x-1)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{9}{[\\frac{1}{2}{x}^{2}-x]}_{3}^{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{9}([\\frac{1}{2}(4)^{2}-(4)]-[\\frac{1}{2}(3)^{2}-(3)]) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{9}(8-4-\\frac{9}{2}+3) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{9}(\\frac{5}{2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{18}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-158420/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "17408f35-ef57-5eb2-8cb6-3a946194d2d3"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-158420"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-158445/selection/5350dbb3303540d5ae935fef7f957960d869d647b551207fb2b9b5fdec6dd39e" :answer/id #uuid "eed4a02f-ecf0-55a1-9c2a-881879cfb13c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{9}{20}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158445/selection/bb661f23c403c9a598e4986d15a92f8940da4f109361cd335aa68eb42aaff52e" :answer/id #uuid "0aeeb80e-61ff-5800-9107-9d98aa874ad1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{19}{60}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158445/selection/df2f5c1832f8a4555f14a71751837a2ed38024cac6fe01701fd9ab8b0f8d4155" :answer/id #uuid "4445cc9a-1d55-5b4a-907a-5cad20f86f48" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{8}{30}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158445/selection/dd7bf2ccda5dc080d4378d788d4d16b33ebcc8f844849e14eb721647895bac95" :answer/id #uuid "434c2a72-3eb4-59f5-af9c-44e40ea213ed" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{13}{60}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158445/selection/f594cbbb4a66bc41743b074d8df31c04839068c3f93c44ebcfba00b647948a3b" :answer/id #uuid "cb84a5a6-bfca-58c3-b62c-0b25c6ae3699" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{20}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158445/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "16fcd673-1e6e-51d6-9690-d893307508e8" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-158445/selection/bb661f23c403c9a598e4986d15a92f8940da4f109361cd335aa68eb42aaff52e" :answer-field/choices ["q-158445/selection/5350dbb3303540d5ae935fef7f957960d869d647b551207fb2b9b5fdec6dd39e" "q-158445/selection/bb661f23c403c9a598e4986d15a92f8940da4f109361cd335aa68eb42aaff52e" "q-158445/selection/df2f5c1832f8a4555f14a71751837a2ed38024cac6fe01701fd9ab8b0f8d4155" "q-158445/selection/dd7bf2ccda5dc080d4378d788d4d16b33ebcc8f844849e14eb721647895bac95" "q-158445/selection/f594cbbb4a66bc41743b074d8df31c04839068c3f93c44ebcfba00b647948a3b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-158445" :question/id #uuid "f73d4938-e911-5c1c-a1ab-37f7eb97df84" :question/math-academy-id "q-158445" :question/problem "Compute $P(-1\\le X\\le 2)$ given that the random variable $X$ has the probability density function\n\n$$\nf(x)={\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{10}({x}^{2}+1),\\, & -2\\le x\\le 1, \\\\ \\frac{1}{20} & 1<x\\le 9, \\\\ 0,\\, & \\text{otherwise.}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "If a continuous random variable $X$ has the probability density function $f(x),$ then \n\n$$\nP(a\\le X\\le b)={\\int }_{a}^{b}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nSo, in our case, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(-1\\le X\\le 2) & ={\\int }_{-1}^{2}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{1}\\frac{1}{10}({x}^{2}+1)\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{1}^{2}\\frac{1}{20}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{10}{[\\frac{1}{3}{x}^{3}+x]}_{-1}^{1}+{[\\frac{1}{20}x]}_{1}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{10}([\\frac{1}{3}(1)^{3}+1]-[\\frac{1}{3}(-1)^{3}+(-1)])+\\frac{1}{20}(2-1) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{10}(\\frac{8}{3})+\\frac{1}{20} \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{15}+\\frac{1}{20} \\\\  & =\\frac{19}{60}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-158445/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "17408f35-ef57-5eb2-8cb6-3a946194d2d3"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-158445"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-158443/selection/17f3ae231a480cff33798464d47b3bea530a423d5d43da4147067e98e897e6dc" :answer/id #uuid "583cb40d-2b17-5674-945a-223a1cfa0953" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{13}{16}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158443/selection/cfb72468d7473f9de7c9ab610be7ad254785b32f2f1aaa989c4331093ae0a062" :answer/id #uuid "c9e26a91-5872-5b07-b2bd-8722efa0d26b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5}{24}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158443/selection/7ca406ed6690410e3c85c046a8fc266540a56cf4545cf1cbb6354f4fdf108590" :answer/id #uuid "75e86377-e956-5315-8c92-7bcde2548261" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5}{16}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158443/selection/b05ae51c7e0f9ce8edef362b0e3bfd104c905bad9c2676254ee36131cb916baa" :answer/id #uuid "0fa73fc7-cc8b-53b8-924e-5ae02f283330" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5}{8}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158443/selection/16ae74f01e8c4faf4ad1eff7ccc47f7a326fb5ff86c3c689a9ac46abfe4a9e48" :answer/id #uuid "9a6caa34-0e96-5b54-887c-adf2abb2b3e1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{13}{24}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158443/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "1c2d74b6-7b2d-56ee-be20-23f4a0ea6be3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-158443/selection/17f3ae231a480cff33798464d47b3bea530a423d5d43da4147067e98e897e6dc" :answer-field/choices ["q-158443/selection/17f3ae231a480cff33798464d47b3bea530a423d5d43da4147067e98e897e6dc" "q-158443/selection/cfb72468d7473f9de7c9ab610be7ad254785b32f2f1aaa989c4331093ae0a062" "q-158443/selection/7ca406ed6690410e3c85c046a8fc266540a56cf4545cf1cbb6354f4fdf108590" "q-158443/selection/b05ae51c7e0f9ce8edef362b0e3bfd104c905bad9c2676254ee36131cb916baa" "q-158443/selection/16ae74f01e8c4faf4ad1eff7ccc47f7a326fb5ff86c3c689a9ac46abfe4a9e48"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-158443" :question/id #uuid "3d314a23-a8eb-5c75-bd4d-fd365ca8fde0" :question/math-academy-id "q-158443" :question/problem "Compute $P(0<X\\le 5)$ given that the random variable $X$ has the probability density function\n\n$$\nf(x)={\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{4}({x}^{3}+1),\\, & -1\\le x<1, \\\\ \\frac{1}{24}x & 1\\le x\\le 5, \\\\ 0,\\, & \\text{otherwise.}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "If a continuous random variable $X$ has the probability density function $f(x),$ then \n\n$$\nP(a<X\\le b)={\\int }_{a}^{b}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nSo, in our case, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(0<X\\le 5) & ={\\int }_{0}^{5}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{1}{4}({x}^{3}+1)\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{1}^{5}\\frac{1}{24}x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}{[\\frac{1}{4}{x}^{4}+x]}_{0}^{1}+{[\\frac{1}{48}{x}^{2}]}_{1}^{5} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}([\\frac{1}{4}(1)^{4}+1]-[\\frac{1}{4}(0)^{4}+0])+\\frac{1}{48}[{5}^{2}-{1}^{2}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}(\\frac{5}{4})+\\frac{1}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{16}+\\frac{1}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{13}{16}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-158443/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "17408f35-ef57-5eb2-8cb6-3a946194d2d3"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-158443"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "e-10839"] :question/problem "Compute $P\\left( 1 \\lt   X \\lt 3 \\right)$ given that the random variable $X$ has the probability density function\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14040290/assets/394c60a510e39043cda5072c0b57a663b200275035d72c15f20c5a257e6c4fc0.png)" :question/worked-solution "If a continuous random variable $X$ has the probability density function $f(x),$ then \n\n$$\nP(a \\lt   X \\lt      b) = \\int_a^b f(x) \\, \\textrm dx.\n$$\n\nSo, in our case, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(1<X<3) & ={\\int }_{1}^{3}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{3}\\frac{1}{18}({x}^{2}-1)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{18}{\\int }_{1}^{3}({x}^{2}-1)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{18}{[\\frac{1}{3}{x}^{3}-x]}_{1}^{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{18}([\\frac{1}{3}(3)^{3}-(3)]-[\\frac{1}{3}(1)^{3}-(1)]) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{18}([9-3]-[\\frac{1}{3}-1]) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{18}(6+\\frac{2}{3}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{18}\\cdot \\frac{20}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{10}{27}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "e-11036"] :question/problem "Compute $P\\left(  X \\leq 3 \\right)$ given that the random variable $X$ has the probability density function\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14040290/assets/1cd6271fdb46d54db66d2b4f5acd10146f42a0dd64a3326ea7e53e07d4915633.png)" :question/worked-solution "If a continuous random variable $X$ has the probability density function $f(x),$ then \n\n$$\nP(a \\leq X \\leq  b) = \\int_a^b f(x) \\, \\textrm dx.\n$$\n\nSince $f(x)$ is identical to zero for all $x \\lt  2,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(X\\le 3) & ={\\int }_{2}^{3}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{2}^{3}\\frac{2x}{45}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={[\\frac{1}{45}\\,{x}^{2}]}_{2}^{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{45}({3}^{2}-{2}^{2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{45}\\cdot 5 \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{9}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "e-11038"] :question/problem "Compute $P\\left( 2 \\leq          X \\leq          4 \\right)$ given that the random variable $X$ has the probability density function\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14040290/assets/e01b36a6a2b00b47ce36b59d5b3e1a4fea4cbc26b0b7d46d60e40638161982d8.png)" :question/worked-solution "If a continuous random variable $X$ has the probability density function $f(x),$ then \n\n$$\nP(a \\leq        X \\leq        b) = \\int_a^b f(x) \\, \\textrm dx.\n$$\n\nSo, in our case, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(2\\le X\\le 4) & ={\\int }_{2}^{4}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{2}^{3}\\frac{1}{9}x\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{3}^{4}(x-3)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={[\\frac{1}{18}{x}^{2}]}_{2}^{3}+{[\\frac{1}{2}{x}^{2}-3x]}_{3}^{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{18}[{3}^{2}-{2}^{2}]+([\\frac{1}{2}(4)^{2}-3(4)]-[\\frac{1}{2}(3)^{2}-3(3)]) \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{18}-4+\\frac{9}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{14}{18} \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{9}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]}]
